WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
After returning to the villa, I had to work overtime all night

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,440
Be careful because you are an old immortal.

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:06,900
Look, there are dark circles under the eyes.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:07,940
Thanks for the reminder

5
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:11,190
I will take good care of Luo Weishanshan

6
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:13,470
Do I really have dark circles on my face?

7
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:14,950
Where are the dark circles?

8
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:16,390
The skin is very white and tender

9
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:20,740
Sister Qingsi, did you hit you with the painting on purpose?

10
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:23,140
You three got up very early today

11
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,260
They all took the documents and waited for the boss to come downstairs to report.

12
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,940
Do you think we don’t want to?

13
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,340
The boss's door is locked

14
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,900
I'm embarrassed to knock on the door

15
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:32,460
Lily just went up secretly and tried it.

16
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,820
Don’t make it up in Chinese

17
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:36,620
I was there to report the legal details compiled by the Hotel Guquan.

18
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:37,940
Found that the boss was still sleeping

19
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,580
I went downstairs immediately

20
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,820
Come on Lily

21
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,220
Wait until Zhao Qian has just left

22
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,060
Just slide back upstairs

23
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:46,380
I also specially sprayed famous brand perfume.

24
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:48,380
This is called simple reporting work

25
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:51,380
I have just prepared the contract and legal opinions and am waiting for the boss to come down
